所以之前智菲说
Suǒ yǐ zhī fēi shuō
So Zhifei said before

938
00:34:03,700 --> 00:34:06,300
有一个小的问题解决不了
Yǒu yí gè xiǎo de wèn tí jiě jué bù le
There is a small problem that cannot be solved

939
00:34:06,300 --> 00:34:09,133
然后就是很头疼啊或者怎么样
Rán hòu jiù shì hěn tóu téng a huò zhě zěn me yàng
Then I have a headache or something.

940
00:34:09,133 --> 00:34:10,800
我说没关系
Wǒ shuō méi guān xi
I said it's okay

941
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:11,900
不要担心
Bú yào dān xīn
Don't worry

942
00:34:12,066 --> 00:34:14,500
这个工作我们会做一辈子
Zhè gè gōng zuò wǒ men huì zuò yí bèi zi
We will do this job forever.

943
00:34:14,500 --> 00:34:17,000
我们会做20年30年
Wǒ men huì zuò 20 nián 30 nián
We will do this for 20 to 30 years

944
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:19,066
所以现在只是一个很小的问题
Suǒ yǐ xiàn zài zhǐ shì yí gè hěn xiǎo de wèn tí
So it's just a small issue now.

945
00:34:19,066 --> 00:34:20,900
所以没关系
Suǒ yǐ méi guān xi
So it doesn't matter

946
00:34:21,333 --> 00:34:22,466
然后智菲说
Rán hòu zhī fēi shuō
Then Zhifei said

947
00:34:22,466 --> 00:34:25,533
你已经想到一辈子了吗
Nǐ yǐ jīng xiǎng dào yí bèi zi le ma
Have you thought about it all your life?

948
00:34:25,533 --> 00:34:26,533
我说对啊
Wǒ shuō duì a
I'm right.

949
00:34:27,533 --> 00:34:28,700
不然呢
Bù rán ne
Otherwise

950
00:34:28,833 --> 00:34:29,633
是的是的
Shì de shì de
Yes, yes.

951
00:34:29,633 --> 00:34:32,266
开心的事情就是可以做一辈子的
Kāi xīn de shì qíng jiù shì kě yǐ zuò yí bèi zi de
Happy things are things you can do for a lifetime

952
00:34:32,533 --> 00:34:33,700
对是的
Duì shì de
Yes

953
00:34:33,733 --> 00:34:37,000
所以我们可能要很长很长的时间
Suǒ yǐ wǒ men kě néng yào hěn cháng hěn cháng de shí jiān
So it might take us a very long time.

954
00:34:37,000 --> 00:34:38,866
都要和大家见面
Dōu yào hé dà jiā jiàn miàn
I want to meet everyone

955
00:34:38,900 --> 00:34:41,200
是的你们不要讨厌我们就行
Shì de nǐ men bú yào tǎo yàn wǒ men jiù xíng
Yes, just don't hate us.

956
00:34:41,200 --> 00:34:44,200
对可能一打开电脑
Duì kě néng yì dǎ kāi diàn nǎo
Yes, maybe when you turn on your computer

957
00:34:44,200 --> 00:34:45,500
又是这3个女人
Yòu shì zhè 3 gè nǚ rén
These three women again

958
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:48,733
对对
Duì duì
Right

959
00:34:48,733 --> 00:34:50,233
我们会一直在哦
Wǒ men huì yì zhí zài ó
We'll always be there

